cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code or the figures, please cite this repository and the underlying data sources."
title: "Famines and Imperial Exams in Ming China, 1521-1619: a spatially explicit panel analysis"
abstract: "A reproducible spatiotemporal analysis of 5,736 famine records and 2,841 normalized 1甲/2甲 Jinshi records on a 1-degree, 114-year grid panel. Reports fixed 1-5 year joint Granger tests, GWR, GeoDetector, and explicit lag-search diagnostics."
